  "details": "A button that allows users to skip various instance settings by using a preset and immediately create new instance. With the recent Open Beta, users can configure whether features like emojis and stickers are allowed when creating an instance. However, this adds more configuration steps, which can be tedious for users who frequently use the same combination of settings. It would be useful if instance type, region, and instance settings could be saved as presets and used when creating instances. Considering the use case, It may be beneficial for presets to include an option to join or drop a portal after instance creation.",
